            "heading": "Shipping and exchanges",
            "icon": "truck",
            "content": "<p>Free shipping on orders over $60 across Canada. Orders under $60 ship at a flat rate shown at checkout.</p><p>Exchanges are free within 30 days of delivery. We cover return shipping and there are no restocking fees. Start an exchange from the <a href=\"/pages/returns\" title=\"Returns and exchanges\">returns page</a>.</p>"
